    "title": "Football League 2024",
    "description": "Viva World Football! Football League 2024 provides a total soccer game experience by immersing you in incredibly lucid graphics and intelligent game engine. \r\n\r\nDREAM TEAM FEATURES\r\n- Over 150 National Teams and 1000 Clubs to choose from\r\n- Quickly adapt, change strategy, and inhibit actions with our highly responsive total game control engine for a crazy real soccer experience\r\n- Create the ultimate team by developing your eleven pro soccer players to increase their skills and abilities to become elite league players\r\n- Come make your dream winning streak a reality and unleash your pro soccer skills with fully customizable tactics\r\n- Win the trophy and be your dream team's hero manager by creating the perfect formation of eleven players while fine tuning along the way\r\n\r\nDYNAMIC ADAPTIVE GAMEPLAY\r\n- Fluent controls and total player motion physics\r\n- Full controller support\r\n- Multi-language narration\r\n- Play offline game\r\n\r\nClassic National Cups\r\n-------------------------------\r\nInternational Cup (Men & Women)\r\nEuropean National Cup\r\nAmerican National Cup (South & North)\r\nAsian National Cup\r\nAfrican National Cup\r\n\r\nClub Leagues\r\n-------------------------------\r\nTop5 (England, Spain, Italy, Germany, France)\r\nAsian (Saudi Arabia, Japan, South Korea, India, Indonesia, Vietnam, Malaysia, Thailand)\r\nAfrican (Egypt, South Africa)\r\nEuropean\uff08Netherland, Turkey, Portugual, Scotland, Russia)\r\nAmerican (Brazil, Argentina, Colombia, USA, Mexico\uff09\r\nCustom League (Customize the league to your liking)\r\nMore Coming soon\r\n\r\nClub Tournaments\r\n-------------------------------\r\nEuropean Champions Cup\r\nClub International Cup\r\nSouth American Champions Cup\r\nAsian Champions Cup\r\nAfrican Champions Cup\r\nAmerican Champions Cup\r\n\r\nFOLLOW US: https://www.facebook.com/playfootballleague\r\nJOIN US: https://discord.gg/m825ft9xGn\r\nCONTACT US: footballleague2023@gmail.com",
